name: power-grid-indicator
displayName: Power Grid Indicator
subtitle: See your power grids on the map
author: Tomáš Rindt
version: "1.0"
minGameVersion: "147"
repo: TousTarm/Mindustry_electric_grid_indicator_mod
description: "Draws your team's power node links on the map, colored by how well each grid is powered. Click any power node to see its grid's production and consumption over the last 3 minutes. Open the map (M) and use the Power grid panel in the top-right corner. Client-side only: works on any server, and other players don't need it."
# client-side only: servers and other players don't need it
hidden: true
